# 统一行尾为 LF：跨平台开发（Windows / macOS / Linux）时避免 CRLF 警告与行尾漂移
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF（批处理对 CRLF 敏感）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件（禁止任何行尾/编码转换）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
*.alc binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.node binary
